ARPWatch keeps a database of every MAC address seen in the ARP and IPv6
neighbour tables of the firewall and sends a notification when a device
that was never seen before joins the network. Optionally it also reports
IP addresses that move to another MAC address.

Notifications can be delivered by email (SMTP), Telegram and Pushbullet.

